  "details": "VRChat Version: w_2021.1.1p1\nDescription of the bug: Whenever you click on a player with your menu laser, click \"Show Avatar Author\" and click on one of their worlds, one of two problems sometimes happen:\n1) The favorite world count in the top right shows up correctly, but the menu that opens up after clicking the \"Favorite\" button shows nonsense. The playlist names are incorrect as well.\n2) The favorite world count is 0, despite having several favorite worlds. The playlist names are incorrect as well.\nScreenshots:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/9CbfbZ5",
